    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500704/2005007040110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005007040120,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "また『ま　み　み』ですかぁ……\r\nこの前あんなに書いたばっかりなのにー",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500704/2005007040120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こら、摩美々\r\nアイドルにとって大事なものだろ、そんなふうに言うな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005007040130,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "えー\r\nまぁ、いいですケド……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500704/2005007040130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………\r\n今回の撮影……摩美々はどうだった？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005007040140,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "別に…………\r\n……楽しかった……かもしれないですねー",
