    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500704/2005007040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……結果的に、俺が一番、摩美々の眠っている可能性を\r\n見せつけられちゃったなってさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "本当は、摩美々と一緒に\r\nお客さんに届けなくちゃいけない側なんだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、今回はそれでよかったと思うんだ\r\n俺にとっても、……摩美々にとっても",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005007040170,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "まぁ、物事の価値は斜めから測るべし……\r\nって言いますしねー",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500704/2005007040170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……誰の言葉なんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005007040180,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "……ふふー\r\n私の言葉ですよー",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200500704/2005007040180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうか\r\n覚えておくよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005007040190,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "はいー\r\n……ふふ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
